<title>FRANCE: EU grain export commitments reach 26.765 mln T.</title>
<headline>EU grain export commitments reach 26.765 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union grain export commitments up to June 3 rose 60.5 percent over last year, official figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Figures supplied by member country officials showed grain earmarked for export between July 1, 1996 and June 3, 1997 totalled 26.765 million tonnes against 16.675 million during the same period last year.</p>
<p>Exports of commercial soft wheat grain reached 9.788 million tonnes against 5.665 million a year ago. Soft wheat flour exports jumped to 5.776 million tonnes from 3.841 million.</p>
<p>Barley exports reached 6.181 million tonnes against 1.723 million tonnes.</p>
<p>On Thursday the European Union left taxes applying to daily soft wheat grain and flour exports and other daily measures unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
